    <p>This website belongs to the initiative Wohnentscheid Frankfurt.</p>
    <h2>Information according to §&nbsp;5 DDG (German Digital Services Act)</h2>
    <address>
      Sven Nagel<br />
      Ostendstraße 9<br />
      60314&nbsp;Frankfurt am Main
    </address>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a></p>
    <h2>Responsible for the content according to §&nbsp;18(2) MStV (German Interstate Media Treaty)</h2>
    <p>Sven Nagel, address as above.</p>
    <h2>Images</h2>
    <p>Drawings and photos: Wohnentscheid Frankfurt.</p>
